	(global_label "TS" (shape input) (at 149.86 287.02 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify right))
		(uuid "b440b8ea-6fa9-5c33-b649-a0803be285d2"))
	(text "EN2 = 1, EN1 = 0: the R_ILIM input limit (0.99 A). 45.3k = 6 h safety timer. ITERM open = 10% default. VSYS" (at 37.82 317.5 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom))
		(uuid "725b2a3e-0ce4-5612-afab-ba80b33f4280"))
	(text "is the power-path output and feeds the LDO, both motors AND the RM2 (Vin 3.0-4.8 V). /PGOOD goes to GPIO9:" (at 37.82 320.16 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom))
		(uuid "0103bbb2-82cc-552b-9bdd-f85d9868184b"))
	(text "the RP2350 has no VBUS detect of its own. J2: solder pads on the back for the cell: + - T. T is TS for a" (at 37.82 322.82 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom))
		(uuid "14fa8016-c9db-5b1c-8d14-d87ebfc65166"))
	(text "cell with a 10 k NTC; fit it and leave R13 off. Without an NTC R13 holds TS mid-window (always charging)." (at 37.82 325.48 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom))
		(uuid "08d382e6-646a-5e72-bbf6-ac03fad206d9"))
