	(text "Two identical PWM channels (GPIO13, GPIO17): AO3400A low side, B5819W 1 A Schottky across" (at 636.08 314.96 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom))
		(uuid "7f32d1b1-ca6a-558e-8e8f-718044928791"))
	(text "each motor, 2 x 22 u of bulk at the pads. R41/R43 hold the gates down until firmware runs." (at 636.08 317.62 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom))
		(uuid "0816bc21-a2c1-58f8-a2fa-8f1844108d86"))
	(text "J4 is three solder pads on the back: VSYS M1 M2 -- the two motors share the supply pad." (at 636.08 320.28 0)
