	(text "Four Infineon DPS368s on the BACK of the board in a diamond pattern (North U20, East U21, West" (at 508.32 327.66 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom))
		(uuid "e98aa844-f80f-5728-a1cb-9c7231968546"))
	(text "U22, South U23), cast in soft elastomer after Tenzer, Jentoft & Howe 2014 (The Feel of MEMS" (at 508.32 330.32 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom))
		(uuid "b7fb2c43-9c2e-51e3-a13b-f7920bcd1c45"))
	(text "Barometers): rubber poured over the array and pressure-cast (not vacuum: DPS368 p.43) so it fills" (at 508.32 332.98 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom))
		(uuid "5eada720-6f14-5751-b232-7cade459b046"))
	(text "the ports; a load on the surface then reads as pressure. CSB low at power-up puts each sensor in" (at 508.32 335.64 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom))
		(uuid "4bf7835a-3a13-5a34-b6d2-9d21c21b7dc9"))
	(text "SPI mode; SPI1 on GPIO10-12, one chip select each on GPIO0 and GPIO14-16. 100n at every sensor." (at 508.32 338.3 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom))
		(uuid "ad9440cb-bd88-5045-86dc-fc0ae248b2b4"))
