	(text "Raspberry Pi's RP2350A minimal design: 3.3 uH on VREG_LX with 4.7 u at the output and at DVDD, 100 n at the" (at 343.86 349.31 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom))
		(uuid "de9d5dc7-d7af-5774-8962-1320ce7e3ab4"))
	(text "third DVDD, 4.7 u on VREG_VIN, VREG_AVDD through 33 R + 4.7 u, ADC_AVDD through 10 R + 1 u, 27 R in each" (at 343.86 351.97 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom))
		(uuid "8ca051e6-77b3-54ad-9b44-a3ae6d13a9d9"))
	(text "USB line, 12 MHz crystal with 1 k in series with XOUT, the reference's ABM8-272-T3 (CL 10 pF) with its 15" (at 343.86 354.63 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom))
		(uuid "fe3237fd-ef71-5b5d-a694-50b03196e15e"))
	(text "pF loads. The radio's gSPI is on GPIO2/3/23/25 (the board file overrides the SDK's data and clock pins)." (at 343.86 357.29 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom))
		(uuid "672f07f2-441c-58eb-a133-c0814ad4c92b"))
