	(text "RMC20452T: Wi-Fi 4 + Bluetooth 5.2 Classic/LE, PCB antenna, modular certification. Vin 3.0-4.8 V from" (at 506.26 159.06 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom))
		(uuid "09dfc6df-a811-55a3-a12a-efee60e8fefd"))
	(text "VSYS (271 mA TX peaks stay off the LDO), VDDIO 3V3. gSPI: GPIO3 clock, GPIO2 data (DIN direct, DOUT via" (at 506.26 161.72 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom))
		(uuid "688a8659-fd7c-55b9-8610-651b81446f1f"))
	(text "470 R, nIRQ via 10 k), GPIO25 CS, GPIO27 WL_ON on pads 12 and 13 (WL_REG_ON and BT_REG_ON). The" (at 506.26 164.38 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom))
		(uuid "62529e7c-7b23-52e8-b184-aa45c40f3ab1"))
	(text "datasheet's RF keep-out -- 5 mm into the body, 10.5 mm either side, 13.5 mm beyond -- is a rule area on" (at 506.26 167.04 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom))
		(uuid "e3328892-5939-5079-bc14-931d508ba56f"))
	(text "every layer; the module's antenna end is the board edge." (at 506.26 169.7 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom))
		(uuid "734e7f1b-2adf-569d-b203-26ec030fe9b1"))
